<title>UK: Bt Effecten sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Bt Effecten sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued 300,000 warrants on the dollar/mark exchange rate, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> RANGE	     1425-1585		 PRICE	  3.90 DEM</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.MAY.97		 PAYDATE	19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS, BERLIN, HAMBURG, STUTTGART</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
